// terrain.ground, furniture.game, object.toy, object.media, layer.marker, layer.litter. Batched: presets of the existing
// generators (building/1, lawn/1, plaza/1, shore/1, garden-bed/1, scatter/2) where one fits, kit/2 for the rest.
// Origin on the floor at the footprint centre, front +z, metres, Eden palettes; budgets per category (vocab.triBudget).
